Package: @PACKAGE_ID@
Name: fish
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: forkless fish shell for jailbroken iOS
 The friendly interactive shell, patched to launch external commands with
 posix_spawn instead of fork. One source and patch set builds both roothide
 and rootless packages; the architecture field names the bootstrap layout,
 not the CPU. Upstream is @UPSTREAM@.
 .
 Run `fish` in a terminal. User configuration lives in ~/.config/fish.
Maintainer: OwnGoal Studio <not-gonna-reply@owngoal.dev>
Author: fish-shell contributors <https://fishshell.com>
Section: Terminal_Support
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= @MIN_IOS@), coreutils, sed, awk, debianutils@BOOTSTRAP_DEPENDENCY@
Recommends: findutils
Conflicts: fish
Replaces: fish
Provides: fish
